  197: /// Whether [position] (a table cell) sits on the table's first row (Up) or last
  198: /// row (Down), i.e. vertical motion should leave the table for the neighbouring
  199: /// block.
  200: bool _atTableVerticalBoundary(
  201:   RichTextDocument document,
